flowchart LR
  World -->|observation, reward| Perception
  Perception -->|subjective state| ReactivePolicy
  Perception -->|subjective state| ValueFunctionBank
  Perception -->|subjective state| TransitionModel
  ReactivePolicy -->|primitive action| World

  Perception -->|feature activity| FeatureBank
  FeatureConstructor -->|candidate features| FeatureBank
  FeatureBank -->|current features| FeatureRanker
  FeatureRanker -->|ranked feature ids| SubtaskGenerator
  SubtaskGenerator -->|reward-respecting subtasks| OptionLearner
  OptionLearner -->|learned options| OptionLibrary
  OptionLearner -->|execution traces| OptionModelLearner
  OptionModelLearner -->|option models| TransitionModel

  ValueFunctionBank -->|value estimates| Planner
  TransitionModel -->|action and option predictions| Planner
  Planner -->|policy targets| ReactivePolicy
  Planner -->|value targets| ValueFunctionBank

  MetaStepSizeLearner -.->|per-weight step sizes| Perception
  MetaStepSizeLearner -.->|per-weight step sizes| ReactivePolicy
  MetaStepSizeLearner -.->|per-weight step sizes| ValueFunctionBank
  MetaStepSizeLearner -.->|per-weight step sizes| TransitionModel

  FeatureBank -->|feature usage| UtilityAssessor
  OptionLibrary -->|option usage| UtilityAssessor
  TransitionModel -->|planning utility| UtilityAssessor
  Planner -->|search statistics| UtilityAssessor
  UtilityAssessor -->|utility scores| Curator
  Curator -->|prune or replace| FeatureBank
  Curator -->|prune or replace| OptionLearner
  Curator -->|prune or replace| OptionLibrary
  Curator -->|prune or replace| TransitionModel

  FeatureBank -.->|feature keys| OptionKeyboard
  OptionLibrary -.->|basis options| OptionKeyboard
  OptionKeyboard -.->|composed option descriptor| ReactivePolicy
